      "message": "I didn\u0027t test this, but it could be written something like:\n\n```suggestion\n# Note that this variable includes the trailing \"/\"\ndriver-libfp-dir :\u003d $(dir $(lastword $(MAKEFILE_LIST)))\n\n# Only build for these objects for the RW image\ndriver-libfp-rw +\u003d fpc_sensor_pal.o\n\n# If there is no private repo, utilize stub functions to allow testing.\n# TODO: This ../fpc_stubs.o should really be handled in a higher build.mk.\ndriver-libfp-$(if $(HAVE_PRIVATE),rw,) +\u003d fpc_private.o\ndriver-libfp-$(if $(HAVE_PRIVATE),,rw) +\u003d ../fpc_stubs.o\n# OR\ndriver-libfp-rw +\u003d $(if $(HAVE_PRIVATE),fpc_private.o,../fpc_stubs.o)\n\n# Make sure output directory is created (in build directory)\n# TODO: I don\u0027t think we need this dirs-y line for a drivers dir, only private dirs.\ndirs-y +\u003d $(driver-libfp-dir)\ndrivers-rw +\u003d $(call objs_from_dir_p,fingerprint/fpc/libfp,driver-libfp,rw)\n```",
